"(jukumu=mtumiaji) <= N (chaguo-msingi 5, au UAGENT_CLEAN_THRESHOLD). Kwa "
":exit/:quit/Ctrl-C, kumbukumbu ya kipindi cha sasa hutupwa chini ya sheria "
